OL,3,GNEWSA'Hefty school fines' and 'new
OL,4,Abellringers sought'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly roundup of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FThe Swindon Advertiser reported on the
OL,11,F"hefty" fines being owed by parents
OL,12,Fover unauthorised school absences.
OL,13,FOfficial data published in August
OL,14,Fsuggested absence rates were "above
OL,15,Fpre-pandemic levels, with nearly a
OL,16,Ffifth of pupils missing 10% of school
OL,17,Flast year".
